    Player: "Treikort is a unique Icelandic trick-taking game for exactly three players using a specially selected 27-card deck. The game features 'BÃ­sefarnir' (Sevens) that are unbeatable when led but worthless when following. A 'Pope' title is earned by winning 13 tricks across 3 consecutive games, granting card-swapping privileges.",
